%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a shading pattern in the dump. A pattern made under a
% translated and scaled CTM fills a rectangle after that CTM is gone:
% the dump's pattern line names the shading and the instance's matrix,
% and the fill's colour line names the pattern.
gsave
100 100 translate 2 2 scale
/P << /PatternType 2 /Shading << /ShadingType 2 /ColorSpace /DeviceGray /Coords [0 0 50 0]
   /Function << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [0] /C1 [1] /N 1 >>
   /Extend [true true] >> >> matrix makepattern def
grestore
P setpattern
100 100 200 100 rectfill
showpage
